{
  "title": "Juicy Mexican Bellflower Root Doraji Tacos",
  "description": "A cultured and cozy Mexican dish featuring bellflower root doraji in a mother sauce base, wrapped in a ti leaf and high in protein. This dish is perfect for a dinner gathering.",
